  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P><SPAN class=black2pt><U><STRONG>contactmusic</STRONG></U></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN class=black2pt><A class=bodyhyperlink2pt href="/new/artist.nsf/artistnames/madonna"><STRONG>MADONNA</STRONG></A><STRONG> plays a game called 'disco tag' with her kids in order to tire them out before bedtime.</STRONG></P>
<P>The pop superstar insists the night-time playtime helps her children ROCCO and LOURDES get rid of any extra energy so they'll sleep soundly.</P>
<P>She says, "It's a fun game. There's a whole performance involved, and you dance, and you're supposed to fake the other person out that you're not interested in tagging them by dancing.</P>
<P><STRONG>"We all play - I play, my husband, the nanny... My son uses all his adrenaline and then passes out. That's a good night." </STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>28/06/2005 02:55</STRONG></P>
<P><EM>thanks to our friend <STRONG>Kramm</STRONG></EM></SPAN></P>
</font></div>
	</td>
  </tr>
