  <tr height="1">
    <td  background="images/riga.gif"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Here's what <STRONG>John LaHair</STRONG>, Director of Marketing / SMG of <STRONG>Worcester</STRONG>'s <STRONG>DCU Center</STRONG>, just wrote&nbsp;&nbsp;for our readers:</P>
<P>Has it been a year already? Here’s to the documentary, tour DVD release and the hopes that Madonna and her many fans will visit Worcester on her next tour! <BR>Enjoy taking a look back by taking a peak and a listen at the attached (<A href="/images/2005/WCC/RITLuckyStar_promo.mp3">file 1</A> and <A href="/images/2005/WCC/RITPresale.mp3">file 2</A>)... we certainly have!!! <BR><BR><STRONG>SHE HOLDS THE RECORD...</STRONG> <BR>It took a girl from Detroit, Michigan to unseat the boys from Boston, MA as <STRONG>the highest grossing multiple concert event to be held at Worcester’s Centrum Centre now the DCU Center</STRONG>. <STRONG>Madonna’s run of 4 sold-out shows (June 27, 28, 30 <BR>and July 1st) during her 2004 Re-invention World Tour grossed a total of $6,439,890.00 compared to the $1,962,055.00 gross that the group Boston took in during their 9 shows held in Worcester back in August of 1987</STRONG>. <BR><BR>The concerts were <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>’s only <STRONG>New England</STRONG> appearances which played 13 U.S. dates and made stops in New York, Miami, Chicago and Las Vegas. <STRONG>Despite the FleetCenter in Boston, MA being unavailable because of the Democratic National Convention, concert organizers recognized that Worcester, MA would be the only choice for a New England appearance by Madonna</STRONG>. During her the Girlie Show Tour, Madonna opted to completely bypass <STRONG>New England</STRONG> and did not play a date in the region. Madonna previously stopped in <STRONG>Worcester</STRONG> in 1989 during the Blonde Ambition Tour. <BR><BR>Check out what’s happening at the DCU Center, visit <A href="http://www.dcucenter.com" target=_blank>www.dcucenter.com</A> </P>
<P align=center><A href="/images/2005/WCC/WCCTransforms.jpg" target=_blank><IMG src="/images/2005/WCC/WCCTransforms_small.jpg" border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><A href="/images/2005/WCC/WCCFrozen.jpg" target=_blank><IMG src="/images/2005/WCC/WCCFrozen_small.jpg" border=0></A></P>
</font></div>
	</td>
  </tr>
